        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/missingno/{size}/2049_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-06-05T19:37:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Normal Stuntman wants to go first but Action Hero Stuntman would vastly prefer having people that get him more card draw go before him so he can keeps up his nova blasting.</p>\n<p>Personally my prefered order is as follows.&nbsp; Normal stuntman-&gt;deck manipulators-&gt;support heroes-&gt;attackers with ongoing destruction-&gt;attackers without ongoing destruction-&gt;Unity/Guise/Base Comodora.&nbsp; Putting deck manipulators at the front lets you react to what is about to come out better.</p>",
