        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/darkroydante/{size}/2044_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-06-06T04:23:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>On the first round, having La Comadora go last makes it more likely that there will be&nbsp;cards in hero trashes for her to shuffle with her base power. Otherwise, having heroes go before her can let the heroes set up 5HP targets for&nbsp;Brig Teleporter.&nbsp;</p>",
