        "can_recover": false,
        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I always face a debate in ordering Team Leader Tachyon, Legacy, and Argent Adept. &nbsp;TLT is great in first position, because she can set everyone up with the cards they need. &nbsp;Legacy is great first so he can boost everyone else, and play Take Down after his turn instead of before it (with AA). &nbsp;Argent Adept is helpful for setup, so is sometimes better earlier.</p>",
        "actions_summary": [
          {
            "id": 2,
            "can_act": true
          },
          {
            "id": 6,
            "can_act": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3,
