      },
      {
        "id": 227767,
        "name": "BrianleWolfhunt",
        "username": "BrianleWolfhunt",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/ebca7d/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-06-06T19:14:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>generally I don't see too much point in optimizing hero turns since it generally only affects the first round, but I have found Stuntman and Captain Cosmic to be the exceptions and a few hero combos as well (DW fixer before Guse, characters that give card plays before characters that use start of turn actions, characters that give powers after characters that need setup). I however, have no problem playing with sub optimal turn order because I enjoy handicapping myself sometimes.&nbsp;</p>",
